      "content": "but they dont see it like that. they see the version of me that was supposed to make them proud. now all they see is the disappointment. it feels so heavy, like i'm just suffocating under the weight of what they expected. if i just disappeared, at least the memory of what they built wouldn't be ruined by my failure. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if they could just remember me as the person they hoped I would be, instead of what i actually became?",
